5.  THE NOTCH IN ITS OWN LANE -- CAN 427 carries |gp-0x6b86|, the biquad OUTPUT, on BOTH
    routes with the SAME packer (`sar 4`, 3.2 counts/LSB).  This is the only channel that
    sees the filter directly rather than through the closed loop.
======================================================================================================================
  ⚠ TWO HARD LIMITS, stated before the numbers:
     * the 0x1AB frame rate is ~50 Hz  =>  NYQUIST ~25 Hz.  **25.5 Hz IS ABOVE NYQUIST**
       and cannot be observed directly; it aliases onto ~24.5 Hz.  Only the notch's
       SKIRT (20-24 Hz, |H| 0.59 -> 0.16) is inside the observable band.
     * the channel is RECTIFIED (|.|), a nonlinearity, so a true null gets partly filled.
     ⇒ this leg can CONFIRM the filter is in force; it cannot refute it.

